---
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.jsx';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.jsx';
import SkillBox from '../components/SkillBox.jsx';
import ProjectItem from '../components/ProjectItem.jsx';
import "../styles/global.css";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>About Me | Kassidy Lewis | Graphic Designer</title>
        <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/portfolio/favicon.svg">
    </head>
    <body id="top" class="font-body text-sm md:text-base">
        <header>
            <nav class="p-6 bg-black" aria-labelledby="site-navigation">
                <Navigation />
            </nav>
        </header>
        <main>
            <section class="pt-6 pb-6 md:pt-12 px-6 md:px-24 xl:px-64">
                <div class="h-max min-h-screen grid gap-4">
                    <div class="
                        row-[1/2] col-[1/2]
                        md:row-[1/3] md:col-[1/2]
                    ">
                        <img src="/portfolio/images/portrait.png" alt="Black-and-white portrait of Kassidy Lewis" class="h-full w-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div class="
                        row-[2/3] col-[1/3]
                        md:row-[1/2] md:col-[2/3]
                        self-end
                    ">
                        <h1 class="pt-2 font-display text-6xl xl:text-8xl">About Me</h1>
                        <p class="pt-4">Hi there! I'm Kassidy, a designer, developer, and ASU alumni with a love for colorful characters and the natural environment. When I'm not seated at my work desk, I'm always searching for something new to spark my creativity. Other passions of mine include digital painting, zoology and wildlife education, playing role-playing games for hours on end, and creating my own original worlds.</p>
                        <p class="py-4">I've also worked with dozens of partners from 2018 to present day, which includes individual clients and local businesses within Arizona. My ultimate goal is to provide the tools entrepreneurs need to market themselves, and to deliver creative works to be enjoyed for years to come.</p>
                        <a href="/portfolio/kassidy_lewis_resume.pdf" target="_blank" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-download mr-1"></i>Download my résumé (opens in new tab)
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="-ml-36 mb-6 md:mb-0 h-25 self-end md:self-start bg-teal mix-blend-exclusion">
                        &nbsp;
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <nav class="my-6 md:my-12 p-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96 text-center bg-black text-white" aria-labelledby="page-navigation">
                <em>Jump to:</em>
                <ul class="pt-2 flex justify-center divide-x-3 divide-grey font-semibold transition-all">
                    <li>
                        <a href="#skills" class="pr-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Skills
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="#education" class="px-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Education
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="#work-experience" class="pl-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Work Experience
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
            <div class="px-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96">
                <section id="skills" class="pt-6 pb-12 border-b-3 border-grey/25">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">Skills</h2>
                    <h3 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl">Tools of the Trade</h3>
                    <div class="pt-2 grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-vsc.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Visual Studio Code"
                            tool="Visual Studio Code"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-bootstrap.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Bootstrap"
                            tool="Bootstrap (CSS)"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-tailwind.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Tailwind CSS"
                            tool="Tailwind (CSS)"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-react.svg"
                            alt="Logo of React"
                            tool="React (JS)"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-astro.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Astro JS"
                            tool="Astro (JS)"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-vite.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Vite"
                            tool="Vite"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-figma.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Figma"
                            tool="Figma"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-xd.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Adobe XD"
                            tool="Adobe XD"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-illustrator.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Adobe Illustrator"
                            tool="Illustrator"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-indesign.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Adobe InDesign"
                            tool="InDesign"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-ae.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Adobe After Effects"
                            tool="After Effects"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-photoshop.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Adobe Photoshop"
                            tool="Photoshop"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-csp.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Clip Studio Paint"
                            tool="Clip Studio Paint"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-blender.svg"
                            alt="Logo of Blender"
                            tool="Blender"
                            progress="w-[25%]"
                            exp="Learning"
                        />
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="pt-6 font-display text-2xl">Specialties</h3>
                    <div class="pt-2 grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-html.svg"
                            alt="Logo of HTML5"
                            tool="HTML/CSS"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-js.svg"
                            alt="Logo of JavaScript"
                            tool="JavaScript"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-code.svg"
                            alt="Wireframe icon"
                            tool="Responsive design"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-code.svg"
                            alt="Wireframe icon"
                            tool="Wireframing"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-brush.svg"
                            alt="Paintbrush icon"
                            tool="Concept sketching"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-brush.svg"
                            alt="Paintbrush icon"
                            tool="Digital illustration"
                            progress="w-[95%]"
                            exp="Expert"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-brush.svg"
                            alt="Paintbrush icon"
                            tool="Branding & identity"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-film.svg"
                            alt="Film icon"
                            tool="Storyboarding"
                            progress="w-[75%]"
                            exp="Proficient"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-film.svg"
                            alt="Film icon"
                            tool="Motion graphics"
                            progress="w-[50%]"
                            exp="Capable"
                        />
                        <SkillBox
                            icon="/portfolio/images/svg/icon-film.svg"
                            alt="Film icon"
                            tool="Video editing"
                            progress="w-[50%]"
                            exp="Capable"
                        />
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section id="education" class="py-12 border-b-3 border-grey/25">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">Education</h2>
                    <h3 class="pt-4 pb-1 font-display text-2xl">Arizona State University</h3>
                    <p class="pb-2">
                        <span class="font-semibold">B.S. in Graphic Design</span> / 2020 to 2025, graduated May 2025
                    </p>
                    <p>I am an alumni of The Design School within the Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts. As an upperclassman, I was enrolled in courses such as Technology for Design, Motion Graphics / Interaction Design, and Regenerative Graphic Design.</p>
                    <p class="py-4">
                        <a href="#skills" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            View my Clock Exhibit project<i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right ml-1 text-xs"></i>
                        </a>
                    </p>
                    <ProjectItem
                        src="/portfolio/images/design/clock_entrance.png"
                        alt="Screenshot of a building entrance in a 3D environment"
                        url="/portfolio/clock-exhibit/"
                        title="Clock Exhibit"
                        desc="2024, Multimedia"
                    />
                    <h3 class="pt-6 pb-1 font-display text-2xl">Huntington University Arizona</h3>
                    <p>
                        <span class="font-semibold">B.S. in Animation</span> / 2018 to 2020, transferred to Arizona State University
                    </p>
                    <p class="pt-2">Before ultimately deciding to transfer to Arizona State University, I completed undergraduate courses such as 3D Computer Graphics I, Storyboard and Concept, and Web Design at HUAZ.</p>
                </section>
                <section id="work-experience" class="py-12 border-b-3 border-grey/25">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">Work Experience</h2>
                    <h3 class="pt-4 pb-1 font-display text-2xl">Freelance Designer</h3>
                    <p class="pb-2">
                        <span class="font-semibold">Self-employed</span> / 2018 to present
                    </p>
                    <p>Currently, I manage a wide variety of projects involving digital illustration, website design, and the creation of assets such as logos, among other tasks. I have worked with individual clients as well as local businesses within Arizona, such as Alesco Design Solutions. My responsibilities include completing thumbnail sketches and wireframes, presenting a design brief, and communicating with clients across multiple revision stages.</p>
                    <p class="py-4">
                        <a href="#skills" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            View my commission work<i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right ml-1 text-xs"></i>
                        </a>
                    </p>
                    <ProjectItem
                        src="/portfolio/images/illustration/commission_3.png"
                        alt="A winged character with long violet hair kneeling against an orange background"
                        url="/portfolio/commission-work/"
                        title="Commission Work"
                        desc="2018 to present, character artwork"
                    />
                    <h3 class="pt-6 pb-1 font-display text-2xl">Package Handler</h3>
                    <p class="pb-2">
                        <span class="font-semibold">Atomic Ammunition</span> / Phoenix, AZ / 2020
                    </p>
                    <p>I was responsible for labelling and sorting packages in a warehouse environment. Additionally, I participated in loading packages onto palettes alongside other workers, and assisted in daily work area maintenance.</p>
                </section>
                <section class="py-12">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">Why Me?</h2>
                    <p class="pt-4">If you're searching for a creative mind who will go above and beyond in terms of organization, timeliness, and problem-solving, I'm your person. My freelance experience has made me incredibly skilled at maintaining my work-life balance. Additionally, I'm always searching for external inspiration for my work, which keeps me in touch with current design trends. If you share my interest in the natural environment and sustainable design practices as well, that's a bonus!</p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </main>
        <footer class="py-12 px-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96 text-white bg-black">
            <Footer />
        </footer>
        <!-- Scripts -->
        <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/f3040639fe.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
        <noscript>Your browser does not support JavaScript!</noscript>
    </body>
</html>